# Privacy Policy - Anilia Factory

Anilia Factory is a private tool used only by its owner to publish videos to
the owner's own YouTube channel through YouTube API Services.

What it accesses: the owner's YouTube channel, in order to upload videos and
to set or change their title, description, tags, thumbnail and visibility.

What it collects: nothing about anyone else. It has no other users, no
analytics and no advertising. It does not sell or share any data.

What it stores: the OAuth tokens that Google issues to the owner. They are
kept as encrypted secrets of the owner's private repository and are used only
to perform uploads. Access can be revoked at any time at
https://myaccount.google.com/permissions

The tool uses YouTube API Services. By using it, the owner agrees to the
YouTube Terms of Service (https://www.youtube.com/t/terms). Google's Privacy
Policy applies: https://policies.google.com/privacy

